[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Working through the battery compartment, undo the top starter\nmotor bolt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045023.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Open  the cover (1a), undo the nuts (1b) and disconnect the electrical\nconnections (1c) for the alternator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428190\">A20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the starter motor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052919.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and disconnect the electrical connections\n(1b) from the starter motor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428191\">A20A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428194\">A20B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the lower fixing bolt (2a) and remove the starter motor\n(2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045024.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the starter motor (1a) back in its housing and fix it tightening\nthe bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>STARTER MOTOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connections (3a) to the starter motor,\nfix them using the nut (2b) and close protective cover (2c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052920.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the starter motor is not damaged.</p><p>1. Replace the starter motor in its housing and fix it tightening\nthe lower bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>STARTER MOTOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.4 ÷ 3.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect electrical connections (2a) and tighten nuts (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045025.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Tighten the upper motor bolt to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>STARTER MOTOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.4 ÷ 3.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045026.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]